### Optimization experiment

Compare:

- 10,000 individual small files.
- A smaller number of larger files containing the same records.

Measure:

- Listing time.
- Job startup time.
- Number of input tasks.
- End-to-end read time.
- NameNode RPC activity.

Do not compare only file bytes; metadata and scheduling are the point of the experiment.

